---
import Layout from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { base } from "../lib/site";
---
<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Jade Zhao, 赵郎溪, Indiana University student. The person behind @zhao.langxi, and why this door is a come-to-IU map right now."
  canonical="https://zhao-langxi.github.io/zhao-langxi/about.html"
  current="about"
>
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <header>
      <div>
        <p>About this door</p>
        <h1>Jade Zhao · <span lang="zh-Hans">赵郎溪</span></h1>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img alt="Jade Zhao, profile photo." class="author-avatar" decoding="async" height="120" src={`${base}assets/site-pfp.jpg`} width="120" />
      </div>
    </header>
    <article class="prose">
      <h2>Who writes</h2>
      <p>
        Hi, I'm Jade. Informatics student at Indiana University Luddy, expected May 2027. Minors in
        Business Technology and user-experience (UX) research. Hudson &amp; Holland Scholar.
        First-generation college student. I speak English, Fuzhounese, and Spanish.
      </p>
      <p>
        I grew up in a family Chinese restaurant in central Indiana (Greenfield, Indiana). The Instagram
        is <a href="https://www.instagram.com/zhao.langxi" rel="noopener noreferrer">@zhao.langxi</a>.
        The bio is the original story: <em>xiao mao diao yu</em> ... little cat fishing ...
        <em>pov reformed ipad kid</em>.
      </p>
      <p>
        <span lang="zh-Hans">小猫钓鱼</span> is the childhood story I keep beside questions about
        large language models: what deserves attention, and what is only a butterfly. The full
        retelling lives on the
        <a href={`${base}xiao-mao-diao-yu.html`}>小猫钓鱼</a> page. I do not keep a cat biography
        here. The kitten is a picture-book companion, not a pet claim.
      </p>
      <h2>What this site is doing right now</h2>
      <p>
        A come-to-IU map. Campus, Indiana, Spain. Social-butterfly notes from a student who already lives
        here, not a recruitment office. Digital Humans writing is on hiatus. The older essays stay in the
        <a href={`${base}archive.html`}>archive</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>What I do when I am not in a dining hall</h2>
      <p>
        Film photography. Gardening. Reading. Walking. Matcha. Hosting get-togethers. A duck-farm
        throughline that is culture, not a product launch. Spring 2026 I studied at Universidad
        Complutense de Madrid.
      </p>
      <h2>Where the other work lives</h2>
      <p>
        Case studies and the résumé belong on
        <a href="https://jadexzhao.github.io/jadexzhao/" rel="noopener noreferrer">jadexzhao</a>.
        Coursework and handoff guides belong on
        <a href="https://matchaxmoxie.github.io/matchaxmoxie/" rel="noopener noreferrer">matchaxmoxie</a>.
        Hire narrative belongs on
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/zhao-langxi/" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://jadexzhao.github.io/jadexzhao/resume.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer">Résumé (PDF)</a> ·
        <a href="mailto:jlzhao@iu.edu">jlzhao@iu.edu</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
